+## Workspace pane locking
+
+`ExperimentalAppPanel.experimental_setPaneLocked(boolean)` locks the calling workspace pane and returns false outside a desktop pane. State persists in the tab-local split layout. The lock protects closing, replacement, movement and resizing; internal plugin navigation remains available. Stabilize after reviewing keyboard, compact viewport, persistence, and all-locked capacity behavior.
